<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FAA Records Checklist</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
    color: #222;
    position: relative;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 90px 40px 90px;
    min-height: 1400px;
  }
  .header-label {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .checkbox-icon {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border: 4px solid #000;
    position: relative;
    margin-right: 30px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .checkbox-icon::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 8px;
    top: 18px;
    width: 34px;
    height: 16px;
    border-bottom: 6px solid #000;
    border-right: 6px solid #000;
    transform: rotate(-45deg) scaleX(0.9);
  }
  .title-text {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 32px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: #111;
  }
  table.checklist {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  table.checklist thead th {
    background-color: #b5b7b9;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color: #0d5c8a;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 17px;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  table.checklist th.status-col {
    width: 90px;
  }
  table.checklist th.records-col {
    width: 340px;
  }
  table.checklist td {
    vertical-align: top;
    padding: 20px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  td.status-cell {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cb {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border: 2.5px solid #000;
  }
  td.records-cell {
    padding-right: 20px;
  }
  td.contact-cell {
    white-space: normal;
  }
  .contact-cell div {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page-num {
    position: absolute;
    left: -90px;
    bottom: 260px;
    background-color: #0d7bb0;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 20px;
    padding: 8px 14px 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
  }
  .side-tab {
    position: absolute;
    left: -90px;
    bottom: 300px;
    width: 40px;
    height: 90px;
    background-color: #b5b7b9;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }
  .figure-caption {
    margin-top: 250px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .bottom-page-num {
    position: absolute;
    left: -90px;
    bottom: 0;
    background-color: #0d7bb0;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 18px;
    padding: 8px 14px 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="side-tab"></div>
  <div class="page-num">11</div>

  <div class="header-label">Plane Sense</div>

  <div class="title-row">
    <div class="checkbox-icon"></div>
    <div class="title-text">FAA RECORDS CHECKLIST</div>
  </div>

  <table class="checklist">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th class="status-col">STATUS</th>
        <th class="records-col">RECORDS</th>
        <th>CONTACT INFORMATION</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td class="status-cell"><span class="cb"></span></td>
        <td class="records-cell">Aircraft Documents</td>
        <td class="contact-cell">
          <div>Federal Aviation Administration</div>
          <div>Aircraft Registration Branch, AFS-750</div>
          <div>P.O. Box 25504</div>
          <div>Oklahoma City, OK 73125</div>
          <div>(405) 954-3116</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="status-cell"><span class="cb"></span></td>
        <td class="records-cell">Airman Records (Replacement Certificate)</td>
        <td class="contact-cell">
          <div>Federal Aviation Administration</div>
          <div>Airmen Certification Branch, AFS-760</div>
          <div>P.O. Box 25082</div>
          <div>Oklahoma City, OK 73125</div>
          <div>(405) 954-3261</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="status-cell"><span class="cb"></span></td>
        <td class="records-cell">Airman Medical Records</td>
        <td class="contact-cell">
          <div>Federal Aviation Administration</div>
          <div>Aeromedical Certification Branch, AAM-331</div>
          <div>P.O. Box 26080</div>
          <div>Oklahoma City, OK 73126-5063</div>
          <div>(405) 954-4821</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="status-cell"><span class="cb"></span></td>
        <td class="records-cell">FOIA Desk (Third Party Request, Duplicate Medical Certificate)</td>
        <td class="contact-cell">
          <div>Federal Aviation Administration</div>
          <div>Aeromedical Certification Branch, AAM-331</div>
          <div>Attention: FOIA Desk</div>
          <div>P.O. Box 26200</div>
          <div>Oklahoma City, OK 73125-9914</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="figure-caption">
    <strong>Figure 11-1.</strong> <em>FAA Records Checklist</em>. The easiest way to locate information on obtaining records from the FAA
    is on the FAA website at <u>www.faa.gov</u>. You can also use this checklist to determine which FAA branch to contact
    regarding the records requested.
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-page-num">11-4</div>

</body>
</html>
